    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "SAN FRANCISCO\nOAKLAND\nEFFECTIVE SEPTEMBER 10, 1962\nUNITED\nONLY UNITED OFFERS\nDC-8 JETS NONSTOP\nTO NEW YORK\n(see map page)",
      "VANCOUVER\nSEATTLE /TACOMA\nSPOKANE\nPENDESTON\nBOISE\nHONOLULU\nPORTLAND\nSALEM\nEUGENE\nMEDFORD\nELKO\nRENO\nSAN FRANCISCO\nOAKLAND\nSALINAS\nMONTEREY\nSACRAMENTO\nSTOCKTON\nMODESTO\nMERCED\nFRESNO\nVISALIA\nBAKERSFIELD\nSANTA BARBARA\nLOS ANGELES\nLONG BEACH\nSAN DIEGO\nSALT LAKE CITY\nGRAND JUNCTION\nDENVER\nLAS VEGAS\nMINNEAPOLIS /ST. PAUL\nTAWAUKEE\nSAGINAW/BAY CITY /MIDLAND\nMUSKEGON FLINT\nLANSING\nROCHESTER\nBUFFALO\nHARTFORD SPA\nELMIRA CORNING\nBOSTON\nHELD\nCEDAR RAPID\nDES MOINES\nCHICAGO\nOUTH BEND\nFORT WAYNE\nDETROIT\nWILLIAMSPORT\nOLEVELAND\nTOLEDI\nYOUNGSTOWN WARR\nAKRON/CANTON SHARON\nALLENT\nPITTSBURGH\nHARRISBU\nPROVIDENCE\nNEW YORK\nREMARK\nIN BETHLEHEM /EASTON\nPHILADELPHIA\nOMAHA\nMULINE /ROCK ISLAND /DAVENPORT\nDAYTON\nCOLUMBUS\nLINCOLN\nBALTIMORE\nWASHINGTON\nNEWPORT NEWS\nHAMPTON WILLIAMSBURG\nCHARLESTON\nRICHMOND\nNORFOLK PORTSMOUTH\nBRISTOL JOHNSON CITY /KINGSPORT\nKANSAS CITY\nGREENSBORO /HIGH POINT\nWINSTON:SALEM\nRALEIGH/DURHAM\nKNOXVILLE\nASHEVILLE\nCHATTANOOGA\nCHARLOTT\nMEMPHIS\nHUNTSVILLE DECATUR\nATLANTA\nBIRMINGHAM\nJACKSONVILLE\nMOBILE\nNEW ORLEANS\nTAMPA\nST. PETERSBURG\nCLEARWATER\nUNITED FLIES BY ELGIN WATCH TIME\nWEST PALM BEACH\nFORT LAUDERDALE\nMIAMI\nPowerful United DC-8 MARK IV* jets soar nonstop to\nNew York at these convenient times:\n0 AM\nAM\n130\n10PM\nEnjoy new speed and comfort on a DC-8 MARK IV* jet to\nNew York... and to Honolulu\n* United's\ndesignation\nof the\nadvanced DC-8 model\nequipped with more powerful JT-4 and turbofan engines.\nFLY THE EXTRA CARE AIRLINE\nUNITED"
